  "title": {
    "zh": "儿童积木帐篷户外拼插游戏套装",
    "en": "Kids Fort Interlocking Outdoor Set"
  },
  "summary": {
    "zh": "这是一款儿童积木帐篷拼插游戏套装，采用PP结构件，适用于家庭互动和室内外活动场景。\n\n产品产地为东莞茶山，适用于4-6岁儿童的拆装房子与创意拼搭玩法。",
    "en": "This is a kids fort interlocking game set made with PP structural parts, suitable for family interaction and both indoor and outdoor activity scenarios.\n\nProduced in Chashan, Dongguan, it is suitable for ages 4-6 in detachable house and creative construction play."
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": [
      "该款儿童积木帐篷户外拼插游戏套装采用模块化拼接结构，可围绕帐篷、通道和互动空间进行多形态搭建，适合持续创意构建。",
      "产品支持室内外场景使用，适用于亲子互动、课程活动与小组游戏，可用于动手实践、手眼协调与协作玩法训练。",
      "包装参数包含体积、重量和尺寸信息，便于渠道陈列、仓配管理与批量采购。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "This kids fort interlocking outdoor set uses a modular interlocking structure and supports multiple layouts around tents, tunnels, and interactive spaces for continuous creative construction play.",
      "It supports indoor and outdoor scenarios and is suitable for parent-child interaction, classroom activities, and group play, helping with hands-on practice, hand-eye coordination, and collaborative use cases.",
      "Packaging data includes volume, weight, and size information for channel display, warehouse operations, and bulk procurement."
    ]
  },
